.\" Man page for waymap
.\" Contact trixsec@proton.me to correct errors or typos.
.TH waymap 1 "26 July 2026" "8.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
waymap \- Advanced Web Application Security Scanner with AI-powered vulnerability analysis
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B waymap
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Waymap is a fast, practical web vulnerability scanner for authorized security testing. It automates SQLi, XSS, command injection, SSTI, LFI, CORS, CRLF, open redirect, API, recon, misconfiguration, and WordPress checks - with session-based results, multi-threading, crawling, authentication, reporting, Google dork discovery, and AI-powered vulnerability analysis.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Target Options
.TP
.B \-t, \-\-target URL
Single target URL to scan.
.TP
.B \-\-multi\-target FILE, \-mt FILE
File containing one target URL per line.
.SS Scan Configuration
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-scan TYPE
Select a scan type. Available types: sqli, xss, cmdi, ssti, lfi, open-redirect, crlf, cors, api, all, recon, misconfig, redirect, injection-advanced, graphql-suite, auth-logic, cache-smuggling, wordpress-extras, optional.
.TP
.B \-c, \-\-crawl N
Crawl depth for target discovery (0–10).
.TP
.B \-\-threads N
Thread count for scan operations.
.TP
.B \-k, \-\-technique BETUIS
SQLi technique string: B (boolean), E (error), T (time), U (union), I (inline), S (stacked).
.TP
.B \-p, \-\-profile wordpress
Run a scan profile.
.SS Authentication Options
.TP
.B \-\-auth-type TYPE
Supported auth modes: form, basic, digest, bearer, api_key.
.TP
.B \-\-auth-url URL
Login URL for form authentication.
.TP
.B \-u, \-\-username USER
Username for form/basic/digest auth.
.TP
.B \-pw, \-\-password PASS
Password for form/basic/digest auth.
.TP
.B \-\-token TOKEN
Bearer token or API key value.
.TP
.B \-\-auth-header HEADER
Header name for API key authentication (default: X-API-Key).
.SS API Scanning
.TP
.B \-\-api-type TYPE
API type: rest or graphql.
.TP
.B \-\-api-endpoints PATHS
Comma-separated REST endpoints.
.SS Discovery (Google Dorks)
.TP
.B \-\-dork QUERY
Run a SerpApi-powered Google dork.
.TP
.B \-\-dork-api-key KEY
SerpApi key override.
.TP
.B \-\-dork-output FILE
Save discovered URLs to a custom file.
.SS AI/LLM Features
.TP
.B \-\-use-ai
Enable all AI features (result analysis + AI reports + payloads + discovery).
.TP
.B \-\-analyze
Analyze results with AI after scan.
.TP
.B \-\-ai-report
Generate AI-enhanced reports.
.TP
.B \-\-ai-payloads
Use AI-generated adaptive payloads.
.TP
.B \-\-ai-discovery
Use AI for attack surface discovery.
.TP
.B \-\-llm-provider PROVIDER
Select LLM provider: none, groq, cerebras, openai, anthropic, ollama.
.TP
.B \-\-llm-model MODEL
Specify LLM model to use.
.SS WPScan API
.TP
.B \-\-wpscan-token TOKEN
Token for WPScan API usage in WordPress profiles.
.SS WAF Detection
.TP
.B \-\-check-waf
Detect WAF on target.
.TP
.B \-\-waf URL
Check WAF for a specific URL.
.SS Reporting
.TP
.B \-\-report-format FORMAT
Comma-separated formats: html, csv, markdown, pdf.
.TP
.B \-\-output-dir DIR
Directory to store reports (default: reports).
.SS Utility & UX
.TP
.B \-\-check-updates
Check for new Waymap versions.
.TP
.B \-\-no-prompt
Disable interactive confirmation prompts.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Verbose output.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Basic XSS scan with crawl
waymap \-\-target https://example.com \-\-scan xss \-\-crawl 2
.TP
SQL injection scan
waymap \-\-target "https://example.com/page.php?id=1" \-\-scan sqli
.TP
Full scan with reports
waymap \-\-target https://example.com \-\-scan all \-\-report-format html,csv \-\-output-dir reports
.TP
Multi-target scan
waymap \-\-multi-target targets.txt \-\-scan sqli
.TP
API scan
waymap \-\-target https://api.example.com \-\-scan api \-\-api-type rest
.TP
WordPress profile
waymap \-\-target https://example.com \-\-profile wordpress
.TP
Google dork discovery
waymap \-\-dork "inurl:.php?id="
.TP
AI-powered scan
waymap \-\-target https://example.com \-\-scan xss \-\-use-ai
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/waymap/secrets.json
Configuration file for API keys (SerpApi, WPScan).
.TP
.I ~/.config/waymap/domain_blacklist.txt
Domain blacklist for dork discovery.
.TP
.I sessions/<domain>/waymap_full_results.json
Per-domain scan results.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SERPAPI_API_KEY
API key for Google dork discovery.
.TP
.B WPSCAN_API_TOKEN
API token for WordPress scanning.
.TP
.B WAYMAP_NO_PROMPT
Set to disable interactive prompts.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
Exit status is 0 for success, 1 for errors, and 2 for invalid usage.
